## Try It

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Trimble006/exploratorytester.git
cd exploratorytester
npm install
npm run build
npm start -- https://your-app.example.com
```

Set `GEMINI_API_KEY` in `.env`, point it at any web application, and watch an AI agent do exploratory testing. Add context files, historical bugs, and role configurations to make it genuinely useful for your application.

The code is open source. Contributions and feedback are welcome.

